  <revision rev="4" vrev="2">
    <srcmd5>6fe8741ce9c8df07f9100b9dbb91d51d</srcmd5>
    <version>1.1.411</version>
    <time>1788018040</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Vendor the pyright npm payload with obs-service-node_modules:
  * build and run without network access
  * use the system Node.js interpreter and remove nodeenv downloads
  * omit the unneeded macOS-only fsevents binary
- Use libalternatives unconditionally.
- Fix env-script-interpreter rpmlint errors on js files in pyright/dist.
</comment>
    <requestid>1374470</requestid>
  </revision>
